services.mpd.settings.description:
Configuration for MPD. MPD supports key-value like blocks for settings
like `audio_output` and `neighbor`. Some of these blocks can be
specified multiple times, so the following configuration:

```txt
audio_output {
    device "iec958:CARD=Intel,DEV=0"
    mixer_control "PCM"
    name "My specific ALSA output"
    type "alsa"
}
audio_output {
    mixer_type "null"
    name "ALSA Null"
    type "alsa"
}
audio_output {
    name "The Pulse"
    type "pulse"
}
```

Can be inserted with:

```nix
audio_output = [
  {
    type = "alsa";
    name = "My specific ALSA output";
    device = "iec958:CARD=Intel,DEV=0";
    mixer_control = "PCM";
  }
  {
    type = "alsa";
    name = "ALSA Null";
    mixer_type = "null";
  }
  {
    type = "pulse";
    name = "The Pulse";
  }
];
```

